  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Rate of dissipation of energy in resistor <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br />Rate of energy stored in inductor <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />In <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> circuit:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mrow></msup></math><br />From equation (i),</p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
